hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Terms\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{\"href\":\"/refund\",\"className\":\"transition-colors hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Refunds\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{\"href\":\"/shipping\",\"className\":\"transition-colors hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Shipping\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{\"href\":\"/cookies\",\"className\":\"transition-colors hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Cookies\"}]]}]]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"div\",\"5. International Shipping\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"5. International Shipping\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"International mail forwarding is available to most countries. Delivery times vary by destination: (a) Canada — 5-10 business days; (b) Europe — 7-14 business days; (c) Asia-Pacific — 10-20 business days; (d) Rest of world — 14-30 business days. Customs duties, taxes, and import fees are the responsibility of the recipient. We are not responsible for items seized or delayed by customs.\"}]]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"div\",\"6. Expedited Processing\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"6. Expedited Processing\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Expedited processing options are available for an additional fee: (a) 24-hour expedited state filing (available in select states) — $99; (b) Priority mail forwarding (next-day) — $25 per forwarding; (c) Rush document preparation — $49. Availability varies by state and service type.\"}]]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"div\",\"7. Document Replacement\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"7. Document Replacement\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"If you lose or misplace your digital documents, replacement copies are available for download from your dashboard at no charge. Certified copies from the state may require additional fees.\"}]]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"8. Returned Mail\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"8. Returned Mail\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"If physical mail is returned to us as undeliverable due to an incorrect or outdated address on file, a $10 re-forwarding fee applies. We will attempt to contact you to update your address before disposal.\"}]]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"9. Abandoned Mail\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"9. Abandoned Mail\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Physical mail held at our facility for more than 60 days without forwarding instructions or account renewal may be considered abandoned and disposed of. We will make reasonable efforts to notify you before disposal.\"}]]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"10. Limitation of Liability\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"10. Limitation of Liability\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Wolfitpark is not liable for: (a) Delays caused by government agencies, postal services, or courier companies; (b) Loss of mail by USPS or third-party carriers; (c) Damages resulting from delayed delivery; (d) Customs delays, seizures, or import restrictions for international forwarding.\"}]]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"11. Contact\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold\",\"children\":\"11. Contact\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"For questions about shipping and delivery, contact: Wolfitpark LLC, 30 N Gould St, Sheridan, WY 82801, USA. Email: support@wolfitpark.online. Phone: +1 (307) 555-0199.\"}]]}]\n3e:[\"$